प्रति-√ भा P. -भाति, to shine upon (acc.), Lāṭy.;
to come in sight, present or offer one's self to (gen. or acc.), MBh.; R. &c. ;
to appear to the mind (also with मनसि), flash upon the thoughts, become clear or manifest, occur to (acc. or gen.), Up.; MBh. &c. (नो॑त्तरम् प्रतिभातिमे, ‘no answer occurs to me’, Hariv.);
to seem or appear to (gen. acc. with or without प्रति) as or like (nom. with or without इव, or यथा, or -वत् ind.), MBh.; Kāv. &c. (

प्रति-√ भिद् P. -भिनत्ति, to pierce, penetrate, MBh.;
to disclose, betray, Daś.;
to reproach, censure, be indignant with (acc.), Ragh.; Śiś.

प्रति-√ भूष् P. -भूषति, to make ready, prepare, fit out, RV.;
to serve, wait upon, honour, worship, ib.; TS.;
to concede, acquiesce in, agree to (acc.), RV.
